package CanvasNet {
    /* cspell:ignore vsdx Visio VisioML xfrm stencil stencils glueable NURBS nurbs shapesheet ShapeSheet */
    /* cspell:ignore PinX PinY LocPinX LocPinY FlipX FlipY BeginX BeginY EndX EndY MasterShape */
    /* cspell:ignore FillForegnd FillBkgnd LineColor LineWeight LinePattern FillPattern */
    /* cspell:ignore TxtPinX TxtPinY TxtLocPinX TxtLocPinY TxtWidth TxtHeight TxtAngle */
    part def VsdxDocument {
        doc /* OPC (Open Packaging Conventions) package parser and VisioML diagram-rendering codec. Opens a .vsdx file as a read-only ZipArchive, resolves [Content_Types].xml and the _rels/.rels -> visio/document.xml -> masters.xml/pages.xml/theme1.xml relationship chain (including per-page and per-master .rels indirection, resolved exclusively through r:id references, never by filename-number convention), and parses visio/document.xml's <Colors>/<FaceNames>/<StyleSheets> and visio/pages/pages.xml's page index. Resolves a page's full shape tree: Master/MasterShape cell-and-geometry-row inheritance (an instance cell with a non-Inh F wins; an instance cell with F="Inh" or no cell at all falls through to the resolved master value; a geometry row is matched and merged, or marked deleted, by IX; a Group master shape recurses per child via MasterShape, matched by ID not position); the StyleSheet chain for LineStyle/FillStyle/TextStyle (walking each StyleSheet's own parent reference until a literal, non-Inh value is found, terminating at StyleSheet ID 0 "No Style", with a literal "Themed" value resolved against an optional parsed theme and otherwise falling back to a neutral default); shape geometry (MoveTo/LineTo/RelMoveTo/RelLineTo/EllipticalArcTo/NURBSTo/InfiniteLine rows resolved into the core Path type, with a safe-skip fallback for an unrecognized row type); the shape-local-to-page affine transform (translate by LocPinX/Y, apply FlipX/FlipY, rotate by Angle in radians, translate by PinX/PinY - identical for a 2-D shape and a 1-D connector, whose own PinX/PinY/Width/Height/Angle are themselves pre-derived by Visio at save time from BeginX/Y/EndX/Y); text (<Text> run parsing against Section N="Character"/"Paragraph" rows and TxtPinX/Y/TxtLocPinX/Y/TxtWidth/Height/TxtAngle text-box positioning); and connector/glue-point routing (<Connects> parsing, trusting a connector's own pre-baked, already-resolved BeginX/Y/EndX/Y page-space coordinates rather than performing live glue-point tracking). Implements the public, page-level Render API: VsdxDocument.Render(int pageIndex, int width, int height, VsdxRenderOptions? options) and a DPI convenience overload, which clear the destination Surface to VsdxRenderOptions.BackgroundColor (default opaque white) and walk a page's shape tree in document order (first shape drawn first/bottom), painting each node's resolved fill, stroke, connector line/arrowheads, and text - composing a group's own already-resolved child transform exactly as described above, with no separate chOff/chExt-style child-coordinate remap step, since a VisioML group child's cells are already expressed directly in the parent group's own local box. An embedded Foreign shape (image/OLE object), a non-solid FillPattern beyond the documented subset, and an unrecognized BeginArrow/EndArrow index each throw VsdxUnsupportedFeatureException carrying a stable feature token; an unrecognized geometry row type or a dangling Connect target instead degrades to a tolerant, no-effect skip. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source (planned): src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Package.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/NamespaceDoc.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Pages.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxPageInfo.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Masters.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Inheritance.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Styles.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Theme.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxShapeNode.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Geometry.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Transform.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Paint.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Text.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxConnect.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Connectors.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxUnsupportedFeatureException.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxRenderOptions.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx/VsdxDocument.Render.cs - this unit's actual delivery follows the Implementation Phase Plan in docs/design/canvas-net-vsdx.md; no source files exist yet as of this planning skeleton. */
        comment testRef /* Test (planned): test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests/VsdxDocumentTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests/VsdxSystemIntegrationTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests/VsdxGeometryTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests/VsdxInheritanceTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests/VsdxStyleTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests/VsdxTextTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests/VsdxConnectorsTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests/VsdxGroupsTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests/VsdxRenderTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests/VsdxFixturesCorpusTests.cs - against the staged fixtures in test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests.Fixtures-STAGING/, to be promoted to test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Vsdx.Tests.Fixtures/ at Implementation Phase Plan milestone (h); no test files exist yet as of this planning skeleton. */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-vsdx/vsdx-document.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-vsdx/vsdx-document.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-vsdx/vsdx-document.yaml */
    }
}
